      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce are delighted to offer for sale, one of the most stunningly renovated homes to come to market in recent times.Welcome to Oak Cottage, a beautifully restored 3 bed bungalow nestled in the serene countryside of Annaghdown, a thriving community located in Co Galway, on the eastern shore of Lough Corrib.Annaghdown is a quiet rural area, with a host of local amenities including shops, pubs, schools, childcare facilities, petrol stations, GAA facilities, a garden centre and horse-riding centre. The nearby Lough Corrib and Annaghdown Pier are renowned for its fishing culture, especially trout and salmon. The natural beauty of the area is a haven for wildlife and offers an opportunity for leisurely outdoor activities with many cycling and walking routes close by.Oak Cottage provides a true taste of the countryside, providing an unparalleled living experience with the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and urban accessibility. This wonderful 3 bed bungalow is exquisite and effortlessly blends the charm of traditional Irish architecture with the comforts of modern living. Spanning approximately 164 sqm and meticulously restored, it offers a charming nod to the past while ensuring the highest standards of quality and comfort. The interior of the cottage features a harmonious blend of new and old with elegant finishes that reflect both tradition and contemporary style.The magnificent high ceilings add to the sense of space and grandeur.Part of the extensive upgrading provides underfloor heating which can easily be connected to air to water heat pump system should one wish to upgrade. Oak Cottage is more than just a home; it's a rare opportunity to own a piece of history that has been thoughtfully enhanced to meet modern living standards. Seldom does the opportunity arise to acquire such a unique residence which combines breath taking views of the surrounding countryside and yet is located just 3 km from village of Annaghdown, 6 km from the village of Corrandulla and a mere 12 km drive to Galway City.Additionally the property is just 20 minutes to Headford Village and 25 minutes to Tuam. The nearest airport is Ireland West Knock Airport, just an hour's drive from the property. Homes in this idyllic location rarely come to the market making this one of the finest homes available for some time. The property has everything you could want from a home in terms of lifestyle, location and natural amenity.Whether you're seeking a serene countryside retreat or a charming family home, this property offers the best of both worlds. Don't miss your chance to experience the unique beauty and comfort of Oak Cottage. Viewing is a must & highly recommended.Keep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database For Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 OFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PMProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie NOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
